as satisfied, so I left it at that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_25","text":"But...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_26","text":"it sounds like you wanted to keep talking to me a little longer, didn't you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_27","text":"I guess I wasn't very perceptive. Sorry, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_28","text":"I'm on set right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_29","text":"The wait's gotten pretty long,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_30","text":"so I got bored and ended up messaging you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_31","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_32","text":"Doesn't sound like much fun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_33","text":"No, this is pretty normal for me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_34","text":"Still, I'm a little excited, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_35","text":"I'll be appearing on a show with someone I've always admired.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_02_36","text":"Oh really? Who is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_02_37","type":"Speech",